<title>USA: O'Reilly plans to open 40 stores in 1997.</title>
<headline>O'Reilly plans to open 40 stores in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Mo. 1996-10-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>O'Reilly Automotive Inc said it plans to open 40 new stores in 1997.</p>
<p>The specialty retailer and supplier of automotive aftermarket parts and tools said during the third quarter it opened nine new stores, for a total of 22 opened year to date.</p>
<p>Eight additional new outlets are scheduled to be opened before the end of the year.</p>
<p>O'Reilly currently operates 214 stores.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
